{"id":"nacimiento","lemma":"nacimiento","pos":"noun","rank":1874,"glosses":["birth (the act of being born)","birth, beginning, start","crib, nativity scene"],"ipa":"/naθiˈmjento/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"nacimientos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/14/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-nacimiento.wav","examples":[{"text":"Era ciego de nacimiento.","en":"He was blind from birth.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/550034"},{"text":"El año pasado, hubo más nacimientos que defunciones.","en":"Last year, there were more births than deaths."},{"text":"Él es alemán de nacimiento.","en":"He is German by birth.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706867"},{"text":"¿Cuál es tu fecha de nacimiento?","en":"What is your date of birth?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/937476"},{"text":"Escriba su fecha de nacimiento aquí.","en":"Write down your date of birth here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1196853"}]}